-- חוזר מח/11 של המחלקה לתנאי שירות — גמול פיצול, 5 כיתות (5.6.1988)
-- The service-conditions department tells the owners of schools that a
-- teaching employee in an elementary or post-elementary school, on a
-- position from 79% to 95% that is split among 5 classes, is entitled to a
-- split allowance of 2% of the full combined salary by grade and seniority,
-- from 1.4.88. It is the earliest source of takanon §1.11's band
-- (l4/takanon/takanon-sherut-ovdei-horaa/1.11.l4, F-1.11-h).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- not weighed against `the Hours of Work and Rest Law`: ‘משרה’ here
-- measures the position, as a threshold of eligibility; it sets no working
-- hour, day or week.

§ `גמול פיצול - 5 כיתות`

-- akn:preamble/p1 akn:preamble/p2 akn:preamble/p3 akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 The letterhead, the date, the circular's number, its addressees and its subject line; no rule.

@desc A teaching employee, as far as this circular asks about them.
DECLARE `split-allowance case of circular מח/11` HAS
    `teaches in an elementary or post-elementary school` IS A BOOLEAN @desc "המועסק בבי\"ס יסודי ו/או על-יסודי"
    `position fraction`                                  IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of one full position held (1 = one full position)
    `classes the position is split among`                IS A NUMBER  @desc the number of classes the position is split among
    `full combined salary`                               IS A NUMBER  @desc "שכרו המשולב המלא לפי דרגתו וותקו": the full combined salary by grade and seniority; an input

§§ `The allowance`

@ref akn:hc_1/p2
`the split allowance of circular מח/11 takes effect` MEANS Date 1 4 1988

-- "בשיעור שבין 79% משרה ל-95% משרה": both ends in, as takanon §1.11
-- reads the same band. The circular speaks of a position split among 5
-- classes and of no other number, so for another number of classes it gives
-- no answer here (another number of classes is outside this circular).
@ref akn:hc_1/p1
GIVEN c IS A `split-allowance case of circular מח/11`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the split allowance of circular מח/11` c IF
        c's `teaches in an elementary or post-elementary school`
    AND c's `position fraction` AT LEAST 0.79
    AND c's `position fraction` AT MOST 0.95
    AND c's `classes the position is split among` EQUALS 5

-- "זכאי לגמול פיצול בשיעור של 2%, גמול זה נגזר משכרו המשולב המלא לפי
-- דרגתו וותקו": 2% of the FULL combined salary, not of the salary for
-- the share of the position held.
@export default The monthly split allowance of circular מח/11 (5.6.1988), or NOTHING where the circular does not speak
@ref akn:hc_1/p1 akn:hc_1/p2
GIVEN c     IS A `split-allowance case of circular מח/11` @desc the teaching employee
      `day` IS A DATE                                     @desc a day in the month the allowance is for
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the split allowance of circular מח/11` c `day` IS
    IF `day` LESS THAN `the split allowance of circular מח/11 takes effect`
       OR NOT c's `classes the position is split among` EQUALS 5
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE IF `entitled to the split allowance of circular מח/11` c
         THEN JUST (2% TIMES c's `full combined salary`)
         ELSE JUST 0

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off of the director of the service-conditions department and the copies list; no rule.

§§ `Examples`

GIVEN f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `split-allowance case of circular מח/11`
DECIDE `a teacher on 10,000 with 5 classes at` f IS
    `split-allowance case of circular מח/11` WITH
        `teaches in an elementary or post-elementary school` IS TRUE
        `position fraction`                                  IS f
        `classes the position is split among`                IS 5
        `full combined salary`                               IS 10000

`at 95% with 5 classes the allowance is 200, at 96% nothing` MEANS
        `the split allowance of circular מח/11` (`a teacher on 10,000 with 5 classes at` 0.95) (Date 1 9 1988) EQUALS JUST 200
    AND `the split allowance of circular מח/11` (`a teacher on 10,000 with 5 classes at` 0.96) (Date 1 9 1988) EQUALS JUST 0
    AND `the split allowance of circular מח/11` (`a teacher on 10,000 with 5 classes at` 0.79) (Date 1 9 1988) EQUALS JUST 200
    AND `the split allowance of circular מח/11` (`a teacher on 10,000 with 5 classes at` 0.95) (Date 1 3 1988) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `at 95% with 5 classes the allowance is 200, at 96% nothing`
